{"id":"n74072-1-7","stage":1,"title":"저금 · 存款","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74072-1-7-1","ko":"자동차를 새로 사겠다고? 살 돈 있어?","zh":"要买新车？你有钱买吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자동차를","meaning":"汽车","explanation":"자동차：汽车；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자동차","audio":"/audio/716907a2f49c42607a15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70799","senseId":"1","lemma":"자동차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자동차를","audio":"/audio/40a619f27aae6cd52450.mp3"}},{"text":"새로","meaning":"重新","explanation":"새로：重新。","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"2","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}},{"text":"사겠다고?","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；다고：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사겠다고","audio":"/audio/3d17a14a54b406a6e3e6.mp3"}},{"text":"살","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}},{"text":"돈","meaning":"钱，金钱，钱币","explanation":"돈：钱，金钱，钱币。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"富有，宽裕","explanation":"있다：富有，宽裕；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"4","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"716907a2f49c4260","term":"자동차","zh":"汽车","audio":"/audio/716907a2f49c42607a15.mp3","entryId":"70799","definition":"用引擎的力量转动轮胎，在道路上行驶的车。","pronunciation":["자동차"]},{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"重新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"与以前不同，全新地；或用新的。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，金钱，钱币","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"买卖商品或作为劳动代价支付或收取的硬币或纸币。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"富有，宽裕","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"财产充足、充裕。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ceb3d8949950c380ba5f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74072-1-7-2","ko":"응, 몇 년째 저금을 하고 있는데 돈이 꽤 많이 모였거든.","zh":"嗯，我已经存钱好几年了，攒了相当多的钱呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几","explanation":"몇：几。","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"1","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}},{"text":"년째","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年；째：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"년째","audio":"/audio/6e553fe74ca638684e60.mp3"}},{"text":"저금을","meaning":"存款，存钱，储蓄","explanation":"저금：存款，存钱，储蓄；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"저금","audio":"/audio/2799c868a41846fb8e1a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74072","senseId":"1","lemma":"저금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저금을","audio":"/audio/4ba71fe04da7774ff35b.mp3"}},{"text":"하고","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하고","audio":"/audio/1a7140c02481d065b267.mp3"}},{"text":"있는데","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는데","audio":"/audio/cef0332a5e3d72106522.mp3"}},{"text":"돈이","meaning":"钱，钱财","explanation":"돈：钱，钱财；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"3","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈이","audio":"/audio/6fc43b50168ec9dd1ba6.mp3"}},{"text":"꽤","meaning":"颇，相当，还","explanation":"꽤：颇，相当，还。","readings":[{"term":"꽤","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38264","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽤","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"모였거든.","meaning":"被积攒，被储存，